    oe:aboutDisease oed:osteoarthritis ;
    oe:answerText "Aging or injury to the joints can lead to cartilage degeneration and osteoarthritis (OA), for which there are limited effective treatments. We found that expression of 15-hydroxy prostaglandin dehydrogenase (15-PGDH) is increased in the articular cartilage of aged or injured mice."^^xsd:string ;
